OL,3,GNEWSAMental health bench will be a
OL,4,A'community effort'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA community has come together to
OL,7,Finstall a bench designed to get people
OL,8,Ftalking about mental health.
OL,10,FThe bench has been organised by the
OL,11,Fgroup Talking Helps Tetbury (THT) as a
OL,12,Fway of remembering Theo Humphries, a
OL,13,F"well loved" member of the community
OL,14,Fwho ran a barber shop in the town.
OL,16,FThe bench will be installed at Tetbury
OL,17,FGoods Shed and has been created without
OL,18,Fany funding, instead the group sourced
OL,19,Fparts from local adverts and donations.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
