OL,3,GNEWSAMental health bench will be a
OL,4,A'community effort'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We want it to be a community effort,
OL,7,Fso if you see somebody on the bench,
OL,8,Fjust go and ask them if they're ok, one
OL,9,Fconversation could change somebody's
OL,10,Fday and give them a tomorrow," said
OL,11,FAdam Silcock, from THT.
